{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628050/extras/07027313e9c43eec2d2cfa86e88ebfa0.poster.avif?t=1771157026\" width=616 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628050/extras/07027313e9c43eec2d2cfa86e88ebfa0.webm?t=1771157026\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628050/extras/07027313e9c43eec2d2cfa86e88ebfa0.mp4?t=1771157026\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game is about exploration and combat - Not so much about logical puzzles and riddles.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's a simple game for poepl who are looking for something more tactical and methodical.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the world and look out for secrets and traps</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in slower paced methodical combat based around timing and positioning</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Avoid confrontation when necessary. Gear up and come back later</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Acquire new weapons, armor pieces and other useful items</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be tactical and smart about managing your resources\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become powerful and face even greater challenges\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover and learn hidden systems and secrets\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628050/extras/a53d9ed52ab47696c6f7e3cc92d46cfb.poster.avif?t=1771157026\" width=616 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628050/extras/a53d9ed52ab47696c6f7e3cc92d46cfb.webm?t=1771157026\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628050/extras/a53d9ed52ab47696c6f7e3cc92d46cfb.mp4?t=1771157026\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cinematic style of presentation with changing camera angles and dramatic framing</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No interruptions from dialogues or cutscenes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mix of dark fantasy and cyberpunk setting in a nineties style aesthetics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >brutal and colorful cartoon violence</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >elves with machineguns, vampires, robots, goblins and skeletons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >some customisation options: selection of color scheme presets for the player</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Movement and combat controls suitable for different input methods: mouse, keyboard and gaming controllers</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3628050?t=1771157026","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3628050?t=1771157026","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628050/62020d51e972896f55032582c3fe6bd7106097be/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771157026","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628050/62020d51e972896f55032582c3fe6bd7106097be/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771157026","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,2,5],"notes":"Con